sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor StationOwner as User / Station owner
participant MeasurementsController
participant GetStationByIdService
participant StationRepository as IStationRepository / MongoWeatherStationRepository
participant RecordMeasurementService
participant MeasurementAggregate as Measurement aggregate
participant MeasurementRepository as IMeasurementRepository / MongoMeasurementRepository
participant EventBus as EventEmitter2
participant NotificationService
participant UserRepository as IUserRepository / MongoUserRepository
participant AlertNotifier as AlertNotifier
participant TelegramAdapter as TelegramAlertNotifierAdapter

StationOwner->>MeasurementsController: POST /measurements
MeasurementsController->>GetStationByIdService: execute({ stationId })
GetStationByIdService->>StationRepository: findById(stationId)
StationRepository-->>GetStationByIdService: station
GetStationByIdService-->>MeasurementsController: station
MeasurementsController->>RecordMeasurementService: execute(command)
RecordMeasurementService->>StationRepository: findById(stationId)
StationRepository-->>RecordMeasurementService: station
RecordMeasurementService->>MeasurementAggregate: Measurement.create(..., alertSettings)
MeasurementAggregate-->>RecordMeasurementService: measurement with evaluated alert
RecordMeasurementService->>MeasurementRepository: save(measurement)
MeasurementRepository-->>RecordMeasurementService: void

alt measurement has alert
  RecordMeasurementService->>EventBus: emit(MeasurementAlertDetectedEvent)
  EventBus->>NotificationService: handleAlert(event)
  NotificationService->>MeasurementRepository: findById(measurementId)
  MeasurementRepository-->>NotificationService: measurement
  NotificationService->>StationRepository: findById(stationId)
  StationRepository-->>NotificationService: station
  NotificationService->>UserRepository: findSubscribersByStationId(stationId)
  UserRepository-->>NotificationService: subscribers
  Note over NotificationService: Filter subscribers by station and alert type\nthen resolve delivery targets before any channel call
  loop each resolved notification
    NotificationService->>AlertNotifier: sendMeasurementAlert(notification)
    AlertNotifier->>TelegramAdapter: sendMeasurementAlert(notification)
    TelegramAdapter-->>AlertNotifier: Telegram Bot API request(s)
  end
end

RecordMeasurementService-->>MeasurementsController: measurement
MeasurementsController-->>StationOwner: 201 MeasurementResponse
